    "tpb_seq": 1,
    "tpb_book": "<div>1.鄭保村(自編)，訊息經濟學，2025年。</div>\n\n<div>\n<div><strong>2.管毅平譯，信息經濟學引論：激勵與合約，上海財經大學出版社，2004(</strong><a href=\"https://search.books.com.tw/search/query/key/%EF%BC%88%E7%BE%8E%EF%BC%89%E9%A6%AC%E5%8F%AF-%E6%96%AF%E9%81%94%E5%BE%B7%E5%8B%92%EF%BC%88Macho-Stadler+I.%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%EF%BC%88%E7%BE%8E%EF%BC%89%E4%BD%A9%E9%9B%B7%E6%96%AF-%E5%8D%A1%E6%96%AF%E7%89%B9%E9%87%8C%E7%BE%85%EF%BC%88Perez-Castrill/adv_author/1/\">Macho-Stadler I.，Perez-Castrill</a>，An Introduction to the Economics of Information：Incentives and Contracts，1994)</div>\n</div>\n",
    "tpb_book_en": null
  },
