    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpc_seq": 1,
    "tpc_book": "<div>1.<strong><a href=\"https://search.books.com.tw/search/query/key/%E8%91%A3%E4%BF%9D%E6%B0%91/adv_author/1/\">董保民</a>，</strong><strong>信息經濟學講義(<a href=\"https://search.books.com.tw/search/query/cat/all/key/Lecture%20Notes%20on%20Information%20Economics\">Lecture Notes on Information Economics</a></strong>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;，<strong><a href=\"https://www.books.com.tw/web/sys_puballb/china/?pubid=0000000173\">中國人民大學出版社</a>，<strong>2005/03/01。</strong></strong></div>\n\n<div><strong><strong>2.</strong></strong>紀沫、陳工文、李飛躍譯，訊息經濟學：基本原理(上、下)，北京：中國金融出版社，頁216-242。<a name=\"_Hlk190268854\">(J.E.</a>Stiglitz，Economics of Information：Basic Principles)</div>\n\n<div><strong><strong>3.</strong></strong>費方域、張肖虎、&nbsp;鄭育家，合同經濟學，上海財經大學出版社，2008。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; (Bernard Salanie&nbsp;，The Economics of Contracts：A Priem，The MIT Press,1997)</div>\n\n<div><strong><strong>4.</strong></strong><a href=\"https://www.eslite.com/search?author=WyJSQVNNVVNFTiwgRVJJQyJd\">RASMUSEN, ERIC</a>(楊<a href=\"https://www.eslite.com/search?translator=WyLmpYrlrrblvaUv5by15YGl5LiAL-WQs-m6l-ecnyJd\">家彥/張健一/吳麗真</a>譯)，賽局理論與訊息經濟\n\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp;台北：五南出版公司，2003/07/01。</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
